Package: nomologR
Type: Package
Title: Guided Scale Development and Construct Validation
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Joshua", "Uhalt",
      email = "Josh.Uhalt@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides an evidence-guided workflow for empirical scale development
    and construct validation, designed for graduate students and researchers.
    The package helps users examine item performance, dimensionality,
    measurement models, reliability, convergent and discriminant evidence,
    measurement invariance, and theory-specified nomological networks. Methods
    are documented from historical to contemporary practice with literature
    references, and simulated teaching datasets with known population models
    accompany the examples. It emphasizes transparent diagnostics, reproducible
    decision logging, and teaching-oriented guidance rather than automatic item
    deletion or binary declarations that a measure is valid.
